  "top_failure_mode": "Recall on ProductCD 'W' is 0.213 against 0.703 on every other product type. W is 79% of held-out transactions and carries 86% of all unrecovered fraud value. It is NOT an identity-data problem: non-W transactions that also lack identity data still recall at ~0.70. W is simply a population the model reads poorly.",
